    <section class='grid' aria-label='Product list'>
      <div class='product'>
        <div style='font-weight:700'>Ritual Starter Kit</div>
        <div class='desc'>A small kit with a 10 ml roller, diffuser recipes, and a printed micro-plan to start a short ritual.</div>
